n a cooking class to learn new techniques and recipes, which expanded their palate and appreciation for cultural backgrounds. They attended a food festival tasting international cuisines and found it unforgettable. They prefer hands-on experiences over passive viewing, finding cooking shows unengaging. They recently opted out of cooking classes they once enjoyed because the atmosphere became competitive rather than joyful.\",\n          \"source_ids\": [\"s3\", \"s4\", \"s11\", \"s12\", \"s19\", \"s20\", \"s21\", \"s29\", \"s30\", \"s38\", \"s39\", \"s48\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"past\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user's own statements across multiple conversations establish a consistent history of passionate cooking exploration, hands-on learning, and a preference for active engagement. The recent negative experience with cooking classes is also documented.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7364, "total_tokens": 7689, "completion_tokens": 325, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-a0012e47440f0429", "protocol": "plain"}, "response_ref": "874e315dbd43d330e01090a852f754ecf101978c8fc5f791784ec59af64fe55d", "output_tokens_estimate": 500, "finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7364, "total_tokens": 7689, "completion_tokens": 325, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-a0012e47440f0429", "protocol": "plain", "sequence": 80, "elapsed_seconds": 56.55431818962097}
