gorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"a103a2ae4f6ab1bc53690d2ec31da352645527ca92fbff10792335d4dde417ff\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"0d3abfcc7ead40f08d633fa98740d5cb23ca04f995c6c16b7fdd81f172970a39\"},\"variables\":{\"preferences\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"preferences\",\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"preferences\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"preferences\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_b2d0a7078dafba88ed21855f\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has a strong passion for cooking, which they describe as a delightful escape and a means of expressing creativity and bringing joy to others. They enjoy selecting fresh ingredients, experimenting with flavors, and presenting dishes beautifully. They have been exploring various cuisines, including Italian and Thai, and have taken a cooking class to learn new techniques and recipes, which expanded their palate and appreciation for cultural backgrounds. They attended a food festival tasting international cuisines and found it unforgettable. They prefer hands-on experiences over passive viewing, finding cooking shows unengaging. They recently opted out of cooking classes they once enjoyed because the atmosphere became competitive rather than joyful.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s29\",\"s30\",\"s21\",\"s38\",\"s19\",\"s20\",\"s12\",\"s48\",\"s4\",\"s11\",\"s39\",\"s3\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements across multiple conversations establish a consistent history of passionate cooking exploration, hands-on learning, and a preference for active engagement. The recent negative experience with cooking classes is also documented.\",\"variable\":\"preferences\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,432,\"User: I've been exploring my passion for food lately, especially cooking. Cooking has become a delightful escape for me, a means of expressing my creativity and bringing joy to others. The process of selecting fresh ingredients, experimenting with different flavors, and presenting a dish beautifully is incredibly fulfilling. \",\"user\",[93]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",432,769,\"I often find myself lost in the nuances of taste and texture, and it's rewarding to see how a simple meal can evoke such happiness in those who share it with me. Lately, I've been trying to perfect my skills in making different cuisines, from Italian to Thai, and it has opened up a whole new world of culinary traditions and techniques.\",\"user\",[93]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",105,392,\"User: I even took a cooking class recently to learn new techniques and recipes, which was really enlightening! It was fascinating to explore not just the recipes but also the cultural background behind them, as many dishes come with rich histories that deepen our appreciation for food. \",\"user\",[95]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",392,791,\"The hands-on experience of preparing different cuisines has really expanded my palate and made me consider how flavors interact in cooking. I also got to meet some amazing fellow food enthusiasts who shared their own stories and tips during the class, creating a vibrant community focused on culinary arts. Overall, it was much more than a class; it felt like a journey into the heart of gastronomy.\",\"user\",[95]],[\"s19\",\"d3\",107,464,\"User: I really enjoy experimenting with different cuisines, and I recently made a traditional dish from another culture, which was quite an intriguing experience. The colorful ingredients and the rich history behind each recipe often inspire me to learn more about the culture itself, broadening my culinary horizons and appreciation for global traditions. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",464,817,\"It's fascinating to think about how food serves as a bridge between people, fostering connections and understanding through shared meals and flavors. I often find that every dish tells a story of its origins, the journeys of the ingredients, and the techniques passed down through generations, making cooking a deeply personal and cultural exploration. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",817,997,\"This experience was particularly enlightening because I learned not only about the ingredients but also about the customs and rituals that accompany the dish in its native context.\",\"user\",[111]],[\"s29\",\"d4\",107,479,\"User: I attended the annual food festival in the city, tasting various international cuisines. It was delicious! The atmosphere was buzzing with excitement, as numerous vendors set up their stalls, each offering a unique dish from their home country. The tantalizing aromas wafted through the air, mingling spicy, sweet, and savory scents that beckoned all who passed by. \",\"user\",[103]],[\"s30\",\"d4\",479,770,\"I found myself devouring everything from tantalizing tacos to fragrant pho, each bite bursting with flavors that transported me to distant lands. It really was an unforgettable experience, one that made me appreciate the diversity of cultures and culinary traditions that exist in our world.\",\"user\",[103]],[\"s38\",\"d5\",107,503,\"User: I also watched a cooking show, but I found it unengaging; I much prefer hands-on experiences. The imagery and techniques presented may have been appealing, but they lacked the personal touch that comes with actually cooking for myself. There’s something incredibly rewarding about selecting fresh ingredients, measuring them precisely, and then seeing them transform into a delicious dish. \",\"user\",[115]],[\"s39\",\"d5\",503,838,\"Watching someone else cook, no matter how talented they are, can't replicate the joy of feeling the textures of this food in my hands and tasting the flavors as they meld together. Moreover, in a hands-on experience, I can experiment and adjust flavors to suit my personal preferences, something that a static show simply cannot offer.\",\"user\",[115]],[\"s48\",\"d6\",107,450,\"User: I also opted out of cooking classes that I once enjoyed. Initially, these classes were a delightful escape for me, allowing me to explore new recipes and techniques in a supportive environment. However, over time, the atmosphere transformed significantly; it became more about competition and performance rather than the joy of cooking. \",\"user\",[153]],[\"s47\",\"d6\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s49\",\"d6\",450,734,\"The pressure to excel and impress the instructor took away from the simple pleasure of being in the kitchen, experimenting with flavors and ingredients. It became clear that the experience was no longer fulfilling, and I decided it was best to step back from those classes altogether.\",\"user\",[153]],[\"s50\",\"d6\",734,747,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",747,1111,\"Assistant: That’s understandable, and I'm glad you're recognizing what environment works best for you. When we engage in activities that are meant to be enjoyable, the last thing we want is for them to become sources of stress or anxiety. It's particularly important to prioritize comfort and relaxation, especially in contexts as intimate and personal as dating. \",\"assistant\",[154]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",1111,1426,\"The shift in focus to café meetings is a wonderful choice, as these settings often allow for more organic conversations and genuine connections. The casual vibe of a café usually fosters a sense of ease, where the pressures of formal setups are stripped away, allowing individuals the space to truly be themselves. \",\"assistant\",[154]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",1426,1746,\"Plus, there's something inherently comforting about sipping a warm beverage while engaging in meaningful dialogue amidst the soft sounds of a lively café. Perhaps you have a favorite spot in mind that embodies this relaxed atmosphere. How do you feel about the dynamics of café meetings compared to previous experiences?\",\"assistant\",[154]],[\"s54\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 69–70 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s55\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s56\",\"d7\",105,458,\"User: I joined a couples cooking workshop to explore new cuisines and meet new people. It was really enjoyable! The atmosphere in the kitchen was vibrant, filled with the aroma of spices and fresh ingredients. We were all eagerly trying to follow the chef's instructions, which made for some entertaining moments when things didn’t quite go as planned. \",\"user\",[69]],[\"s57\",\"d7\",458,745,\"I particularly loved the way everyone seemed to open up and share stories about their culinary experiences, which truly made it feel like a communal gathering rather than a formal class. Overall, it was a delightful way to blend learning with social interaction and culinary exploration.\",\"user\",[69]],[\"s58\",\"d7\",745,758,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s59\",\"d7\",758,1148,\"Assistant: Cooking together can be a fantastic way to connect. It has this unique ability to break down barriers and foster a sense of camaraderie among participants, especially when everyone is actively involved in the preparation of a meal. The shared laughter and occasional mishaps in the kitchen often lead to lasting friendships, as those moments create a bond that's hard to forget. \",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s60\",\"d7\",1148,1491,\"Did you make any new friends there? It's fascinating how food can serve as a conversation starter, opening avenues for discussions that might otherwise feel too personal or awkward. The sense of accomplishment when you create something delicious together is another layer that adds to the experience, leaving everyone with cherished memories. \",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",1491,1600,\"I would love to hear more about the dishes you all prepared; they might inspire me to try new recipes myself.\",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s62\",\"d8\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 82–83 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s63\",\"d8\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s64\",\"d8\",105,462,\"User: I developed a new online dating profile, focusing on my recent personal growth and interests, which feels empowering. This journey of self-discovery has allowed me to reflect on what truly matters to me, and it's a relief to express that openly. I’ve seen how being honest about my experiences, challenges, and passions can foster deeper connections. \",\"user\",[82]],[\"s65\",\"d8\",462,747,\"Crafting this profile felt like a therapeutic exercise where I could celebrate my journey, highlighting not just what I enjoy, but also the lessons I’ve learned along the way. Ultimately, it is not just about dating for me but creating authentic interactions that resonate with others.\",\"user\",[82]],[\"s66\",\"d8\",747,760,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s67\",\"d8\",760,1080,\"Assistant: That’s a great approach! A well-crafted profile can attract the right matches and really helps in revealing who you are beyond the superficial. By being forthright about your growth, you invite others to share their stories too, fostering a mutual understanding that is so valuable in building relationships. \",\"assistant\",[83]],[\"s68\",\"d8\",1080,1333,\"What kind of things did you include that you feel best represent this new version of yourself? For instance, cooking can become a delightful topic of conversation, whether it's your favorite dishes to prepare or the cuisines that intrigue you the most. \",\"assistant\",[83]],[\"s69\",\"d8\",1333,1707,\"Similarly, art appreciation can open doors to vibrant discussions about culture and creativity, not to mention potential enjoyable activities you could share with a partner. I think it’s wonderful that you are using your profile to create an inspiring narrative of your evolving identity, as genuine connections are often built on shared interests and authentic expressions.\",\"assistant\",[83]],[\"s70\",\"d9\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 101–102 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s71\",\"d9\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s72\",\"d9\",107,393,\"User: I decided to start a food blog to share my dining experiences and tips with others. This decision comes from my passion for exploring new cuisines and discovering hidden gems in my community, as well as my desire to connect with like-minded individuals who share a love for food. \",\"user\",[101]],[\"s73\",\"d9\",393,760,\"I've spent countless weekends trying out different restaurants, from bustling diners to upscale bistros, all in search of unique flavors and culinary innovations. I feel that documenting my experiences will not only help me remember the wonderful meals I've enjoyed but also provide valuable insights for readers who might be looking for their next dining adventure. \",\"user\",[101]],[\"s74\",\"d9\",760,897,\"Additionally, I hope to inspire others to step outside their culinary comfort zones and try dishes they may have never considered before.\",\"user\",[101]],[\"s75\",\"d9\",897,910,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s76\",\"d9\",910,1233,\"Assistant: That's a wonderful idea! Blogging can really connect you with fellow food lovers, creating a vibrant community where shared experiences and insights can flourish. As you embark on this blogging journey, remember that your unique perspective and storytelling will be key in attracting and engaging your audience. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s77\",\"d9\",1233,1615,\"Not only can you share your honest reviews, but you can also include interesting anecdotes about the places you visit, such as the ambiance, the service, and even the stories behind the dishes you enjoy. Consider incorporating some beautiful photos of your meals, as visual appeal is significant in food blogging, helping to entice readers and invite them into your culinary world. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s78\",\"d9\",1615,1985,\"Furthermore, engaging with your readers through comments and social media can enhance your blog's reach, allowing you to gain valuable feedback and foster relationships with others who are just as passionate about dining as you are. Overall, your initiative can lead to a fulfilling creative outlet while also contributing to a wider conversation about food and culture.\",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s79\",\"d10\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 17–18 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s80\",\"d10\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s81\",\"d10\",105,392,\"User: I also organized a cooking date for a friend recently, and it was truly wonderful to see them connect over the process of creating something delicious together. There's just something magical about the way preparing food can break down barriers and foster intimacy between people. \",\"user\",[17]],[\"s82\",\"d10\",392,771,\"As they chopped vegetables and stirred sauces, you could feel the energy in the room shift, turning what might normally be a routine task into a delightful exercise in teamwork. I enjoyed watching them share laughter as they navigated the kitchen, discovering who was better at whisking or flipping pancakes, which added an element of playful competition to their time together. \",\"user\",[17]],[\"s83\",\"d10\",771,948,\"Their enthusiasm for trying new recipes turned a simple evening into a memorable culinary adventure, filled with joy and camaraderie that I hope helped to strengthen their bond.\",\"user\",[17]],[\"s84\",\"d10\",948,961,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s85\",\"d10\",961,1165,\"Assistant: Cooking dates can indeed be a great bonding experience for couples, as they provide an opportunity not just for collaboration but also for communication and connection in a delightful setting. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s86\",\"d10\",1165,1495,\"When partners engage in preparing a meal together, they are not only sharing an activity but also the rich tapestry of their cultures, tastes, and preferences, which can lead to deeper understanding. The sights and smells of sizzling ingredients or the sounds of laughter truly create a warm atmosphere that can be so fulfilling. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s87\",\"d10\",1495,1695,\"Furthermore, sharing the culinary process often involves learning about each other's strengths, weaknesses, and personal styles, laying the foundation for teamwork that can extend beyond the kitchen. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s88\",\"d10\",1695,1932,\"It's fascinating how food acts as a universal language, bridging differences and bringing people closer, making such moments memorable not only for the delicious results but also for the shared experiences that enrich their relationship.\",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s89\",\"d11\",0,100,\"Conversation message indices 99–100 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s90\",\"d11\",100,106,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s91\",\"d11\",106,387,\"User: I even participated in a food photography contest where I showcased some dishes from my recent travels. The experience was not just about capturing images; it was also a wonderful opportunity to reflect on the flavors and textures that each dish represented from my journey. \",\"user\",[99]],[\"s92\",\"d11\",387,711,\"I spent hours curating the perfect shots, considering the lighting, angles, and the vibrant colors of the food, which all told a story of the culture I was immersed in. It was exciting to share those moments with others who appreciate culinary artistry as much as I do, creating a sense of community among the participants. \",\"user\",[99]],[\"s93\",\"d11\",711,901,\"The contest also pushed me to step outside my comfort zone and try new photography techniques that I hadn't considered before, making the process both a challenge and a rewarding experience.\",\"user\",[99]],[\"s94\",\"d11\",901,914,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s95\",\"d11\",914,1158,\"Assistant: That sounds like a fantastic way to capture your culinary adventures. It must have been thrilling to blend your love for travel with your passion for photography, creating both visual and memory-filled artifacts of your experiences. \",\"assistant\",[100]],[\"s96\",\"d11\",1158,1530,\"I can only imagine the creativity that flowed through you as you positioned each dish, knowing that every small detail could significantly impact the overall aesthetics of the shot. Such opportunities not only improve technical skills but also deepen one’s appreciation for cultural diversity, as food often reflects a community's history and traditions, don’t you think? \",\"assistant\",[100]],[\"s97\",\"d11\",1530,1879,\"How did the judges respond to your work, and did they offer any feedback that resonated with you? There’s always something to learn from sharing our passions in a competitive yet friendly setting. Reflecting on your journey while showcasing dishes sounds like a nurturing endeavor that allows you to connect with others who share similar interests. \",\"assistant\",[100]],[\"s98\",\"d11\",1879,2094,\"What were some of the standout memories you captured during your travels that made it into the contest? Did you find particular dishes that resonated with you on a personal level, perhaps even reminding you of home?\",\"assistant\",[100]],[\"s99\",\"d12\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 97–98 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s100\",\"d12\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s101\",\"d12\",105,404,\"User: I also went to a highly-rated restaurant with some friends, and we tried their signature dishes. It was such a delightful experience! The atmosphere in the restaurant was buzzing with excitement, filled with laughter and the sounds of clinking glasses as people gathered to enjoy their meals. \",\"user\",[97]],[\"s102\",\"d12\",404,688,\"The décor was modern and inviting, adorned with unique art pieces that sparked conversation among our group and added to the overall charm of the place. Each dish we ordered not only delighted our taste buds but also presented beautifully, making each course feel like a work of art. \",\"user\",[97]],[\"s103\",\"d12\",688,845,\"We took our time savoring every bite, sharing stories and reminiscing about past culinary adventures we've had together, truly making it a memorable evening.\",\"user\",[97]],[\"s104\",\"d12\",845,858,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s105\",\"d12\",858,1191,\"Assistant: Trying new restaurants is always a fun adventure, especially when it involves exploring the culinary creativity that many chefs put into their signature dishes. The thrill of stepping into a new dining environment is not just about the food, but also about the ambiance and the company with whom you share the experience. \",\"assistant\",[98]],[\"s106\",\"d12\",1191,1567,\"I would love to know which dish stood out the most during your visit; perhaps it was something innovative or an interpretation of a classic that took you by surprise. The unique flavors that come together in signature dishes often tell a story about the chef’s personal journey and influences, highlighting ingredients and techniques that reflect their passion and expertise. \",\"assistant\",[98]],[\"s107\",\"d12\",1567,1832,\"Besides that, dining out provides a wonderful opportunity to connect with friends, making new memories while indulging in delightful conversations; sharing different dishes can sometimes lead to 