lable evidence,\nor a different scope/parent version. Ordinary facts and all terminal/audit variables\ncannot use summary_revision. If a complete compatible account is not supported,\nreturn sourced partial/unresolved instead. Multiple new supports must agree on\none whole value. Existing superseded_by links identify retired representations;\ntheir original evidence remains available. revoked holds actual counterevidence,\nwhich is never erased by a summary revision or ignored through its ancestry.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"past\"}}}},{\"if\":{\"required\":[\"summary_revision\"]},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0},\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"},\"summary_revision\":{\"properties\":{\"previous_version\":{\"const\":1},\"supersedes_route_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"fact_cdff19fb66ac66a0dfddefa0\"]}}}}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"fact_cdff19fb66ac66a0dfddefa0\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}}}}},\"variable\":{\"const\":\"history\"}}}],\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"allOf\":[{\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"contradiction\"}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"minItems\":1}}}}],\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"summary_revision\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"previous_version\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"supersedes_route_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true}},\"required\":[\"supersedes_route_ids\",\"previous_version\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"enum\":[\"history\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"Can you suggest some new cooking techniques or recipes I might enjoy exploring?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What cooking techniques or recipes has the user already tried or expressed dislike for?\",\"output_slot\":\"history\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What cooking techniques or recipes has the user already tried or expressed dislike for?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"6b851fdaf2776c9ab50beb2bc0179f18b593c528a85c72e952d6b120193a2f6d\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"a103a2ae4f6ab1bc53690d2ec31da352645527ca92fbff10792335d4dde417ff\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"0d3abfcc7ead40f08d633fa98740d5cb23ca04f995c6c16b7fdd81f172970a39\"},\"variables\":{\"history\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"history\",\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"history\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"history\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_cdff19fb66ac66a0dfddefa0\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has explored cooking through hands-on experiences including a cooking class (message 95) and a couples cooking workshop (message 69), both of which they found enjoyable and enlightening. They have experimented with various cuisines such as Italian, Thai, and a traditional dish from another culture (message 111). They expressed a dislike for passive cooking shows, finding them unengaging compared to hands-on cooking (message 115). They also opted out of cooking classes they once enjoyed because the atmosphere became competitive and performance-oriented rather than focused on the joy of cooking (message 153).\",\"source_ids\":[\"s49\",\"s56\",\"s21\",\"s38\",\"s19\",\"s57\",\"s20\",\"s12\",\"s48\",\"s4\",\"s11\",\"s39\",\"s3\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user's own statements in messages 93, 95, 111, 115, 153, and 69 provide direct evidence of techniques and recipes they have tried (cooking class, couples workshop, various cuisines) and those they disliked (cooking shows, competitive classes). The summary synthesizes these compatible historical facts into one whole value.\",\"variable\":\"history\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,432,\"User: I've been exploring my passion for food lately, especially cooking. Cooking has become a delightful escape for me, a means of expressing my creativity and bringing joy to others. The process of selecting fresh ingredients, experimenting with different flavors, and presenting a dish beautifully is incredibly fulfilling. \",\"user\",[93]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",432,769,\"I often find myself lost in the nuances of taste and texture, and it's rewarding to see how a simple meal can evoke such happiness in those who share it with me. Lately, I've been trying to perfect my skills in making different cuisines, from Italian to Thai, and it has opened up a whole new world of culinary traditions and techniques.\",\"user\",[93]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",105,392,\"User: I even took a cooking class recently to learn new techniques and recipes, which was really enlightening! It was fascinating to explore not just the recipes but also the cultural background behind them, as many dishes come with rich histories that deepen our appreciation for food. \",\"user\",[95]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",392,791,\"The hands-on experience of preparing different cuisines has really expanded my palate and made me consider how flavors interact in cooking. I also got to meet some amazing fellow food enthusiasts who shared their own stories and tips during the class, creating a vibrant community focused on culinary arts. Overall, it was much more than a class; it felt like a journey into the heart of gastronomy.\",\"user\",[95]],[\"s19\",\"d3\",107,464,\"User: I really enjoy experimenting with different cuisines, and I recently made a traditional dish from another culture, which was quite an intriguing experience. The colorful ingredients and the rich history behind each recipe often inspire me to learn more about the culture itself, broadening my culinary horizons and appreciation for global traditions. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",464,817,\"It's fascinating to think about how food serves as a bridge between people, fostering connections and understanding through shared meals and flavors. I often find that every dish tells a story of its origins, the journeys of the ingredients, and the techniques passed down through generations, making cooking a deeply personal and cultural exploration. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",817,997,\"This experience was particularly enlightening because I learned not only about the ingredients but also about the customs and rituals that accompany the dish in its native context.\",\"user\",[111]],[\"s38\",\"d4\",107,503,\"User: I also watched a cooking show, but I found it unengaging; I much prefer hands-on experiences. The imagery and techniques presented may have been appealing, but they lacked the personal touch that comes with actually cooking for myself. There’s something incredibly rewarding about selecting fresh ingredients, measuring them precisely, and then seeing them transform into a delicious dish. \",\"user\",[115]],[\"s39\",\"d4\",503,838,\"Watching someone else cook, no matter how talented they are, can't replicate the joy of feeling the textures of this food in my hands and tasting the flavors as they meld together. Moreover, in a hands-on experience, I can experiment and adjust flavors to suit my personal preferences, something that a static show simply cannot offer.\",\"user\",[115]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",107,450,\"User: I also opted out of cooking classes that I once enjoyed. Initially, these classes were a delightful escape for me, allowing me to explore new recipes and techniques in a supportive environment. However, over time, the atmosphere transformed significantly; it became more about competition and performance rather than the joy of cooking. \",\"user\",[153]],[\"s49\",\"d5\",450,734,\"The pressure to excel and impress the instructor took away from the simple pleasure of being in the kitchen, experimenting with flavors and ingredients. It became clear that the experience was no longer fulfilling, and I decided it was best to step back from those classes altogether.\",\"user\",[153]],[\"s56\",\"d6\",105,458,\"User: I joined a couples cooking workshop to explore new cuisines and meet new people. It was really enjoyable! The atmosphere in the kitchen was vibrant, filled with the aroma of spices and fresh ingredients. We were all eagerly trying to follow the chef's instructions, which made for some entertaining moments when things didn’t quite go as planned. \",\"user\",[69]],[\"s57\",\"d6\",458,745,\"I particularly loved the way everyone seemed to open up and share stories about their culinary experiences, which truly made it feel like a communal gathering rather than a formal class. Overall, it was a delightful way to blend learning with social interaction and culinary exploration.\",\"user\",[69]],[\"s58\",\"d6\",745,758,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s59\",\"d6\",758,1148,\"Assistant: Cooking together can be a fantastic way to connect. It has this unique ability to break down barriers and foster a sense of camaraderie among participants, especially when everyone is actively involved in the preparation of a meal. The shared laughter and occasional mishaps in the kitchen often lead to lasting friendships, as those moments create a bond that's hard to forget. \",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s60\",\"d6\",1148,1491,\"Did you make any new friends there? It's fascinating how food can serve as a conversation starter, opening avenues for discussions that might otherwise feel too personal or awkward. The sense of accomplishment when you create something delicious together is another layer that adds to the experience, leaving everyone with cherished memories. \",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s61\",\"d6\",1491,1600,\"I would love to hear more about the dishes you all prepared; they might inspire me to try new recipes myself.\",\"assistant\",[70]],[\"s70\",\"d7\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 101–102 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s71\",\"d7\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s72\",\"d7\",107,393,\"User: I decided to start a food blog to share my dining experiences and tips with others. This decision comes from my passion for exploring new cuisines and discovering hidden gems in my community, as well as my desire to connect with like-minded individuals who share a love for food. \",\"user\",[101]],[\"s73\",\"d7\",393,760,\"I've spent countless weekends trying out different restaurants, from bustling diners to upscale bistros, all in search of unique flavors and culinary innovations. I feel that documenting my experiences will not only help me remember the wonderful meals I've enjoyed but also provide valuable insights for readers who might be looking for their next dining adventure. \",\"user\",[101]],[\"s74\",\"d7\",760,897,\"Additionally, I hope to inspire others to step outside their culinary comfort zones and try dishes they may have never considered before.\",\"user\",[101]],[\"s75\",\"d7\",897,910,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s76\",\"d7\",910,1233,\"Assistant: That's a wonderful idea! Blogging can really connect you with fellow food lovers, creating a vibrant community where shared experiences and insights can flourish. As you embark on this blogging journey, remember that your unique perspective and storytelling will be key in attracting and engaging your audience. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s77\",\"d7\",1233,1615,\"Not only can you share your honest reviews, but you can also include interesting anecdotes about the places you visit, such as the ambiance, the service, and even the stories behind the dishes you enjoy. Consider incorporating some beautiful photos of your meals, as visual appeal is significant in food blogging, helping to entice readers and invite them into your culinary world. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s78\",\"d7\",1615,1985,\"Furthermore, engaging with your readers through comments and social media can enhance your blog's reach, allowing you to gain valuable feedback and foster relationships with others who are just as passionate about dining as you are. Overall, your initiative can lead to a fulfilling creative outlet while also contributing to a wider conversation about food and culture.\",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s109\",\"d8\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 113–114 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s110\",\"d8\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s111\",\"d8\",107,397,\"User: I tried baking cookies for the first time, but I discovered it wasn't as rewarding as I thought it would be. The anticipation of the sweet aroma wafting through the kitchen was something I looked forward to, but when it came down to the actual process, it felt more tedious than fun. \",\"user\",[113]],[\"s112\",\"d8\",397,674,\"I envisioned myself joyfully mixing the dough, but instead, it seemed like an endless chore with each step dragging on longer than anticipated. The measurements were tricky, and I felt anxious about whether I was doing everything correctly, which took away from the enjoyment. \",\"user\",[113]],[\"s113\",\"d8\",674,839,\"Overall, it was supposed to be a delightful adventure in the kitchen, but it left me feeling a bit deflated and questioning if I would ever want to try baking again.\",\"user\",[113]],[\"s114\",\"d8\",839,852,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s115\",\"d8\",852,1229,\"Assistant: Baking can definitely be hit or miss! You know, the experience of baking is often romanticized; there’s a certain charm in seeing your creations turn golden brown in the oven, but it can be frustrating when things don’t go as planned. What didn’t you like about the experience? Was it the overwhelming number of steps involved, or perhaps the cleanup that followed? \",\"assistant\",[114]],[\"s116\",\"d8\",1229,1598,\"It’s important to remember that something as seemingly simple as baking cookies can actually be quite complex, involving precise measurements, timing, and even technique. Additionally, the emotional investment we place in the outcome can influence how we feel about the process itself, and if the cookies didn’t turn out as expected, it’s natural to feel disappointed. \",\"assistant\",[114]],[\"s117\",\"d8\",1598,1903,\"I would also love to hear more about what kind of cookies you attempted to bake; certain recipes can be trickier than others and may require a bit more experience to master. And remember, even seasoned bakers have their off days, so don't let one experience discourage you from trying again in the future!\",\"assistant\",[114]],[\"s118\",\"d9\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 117–118 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s119\",\"d9\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s120\",\"d9\",107,402,\"User: I entered a cooking competition, but I felt really stressed under pressure and didn't enjoy it. The atmosphere was electrifying, filled with the scent of spices and the sound of sizzling pans, which initially excited me, but once the competition started, a wave of anxiety washed over me. \",\"user\",[117]],[\"s121\",\"d9\",402,714,\"I found myself constantly glancing at the clock, my heart racing as I tried to keep up with the time constraints while also worrying if my dish would turn out as planned. The pressure of the judges watching my every move only intensified my stress, as I felt the weight of their expectations bearing down on me. \",\"user\",[117]],[\"s122\",\"d9\",714,835,\"Instead of feeling the joy of cooking, I became overwhelmed, losing sight of why I love culinary arts in the first place.\",\"user\",[117]],[\"s123\",\"d9\",835,848,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s124\",\"d9\",848,1065,\"Assistant: Competitions can be intense! It’s understandable if that’s not your thing. Many people enter contests with the hope of showcasing their skills, but the reality can be quite different from our expectations. \",\"assistant\",[118]],[\"s125\",\"d9\",1065,1451,\"The environment can create a whirlwind of emotions, from excitement and determination to anxiety and fear of failure, which can lead to a loss of enjoyment in the very activity that brings us joy. It's not unusual for the thrill of the chase—being in a creative and culinary space with fellow chefs and a panel of judges—to morph into an overwhelming pressure cooker of stress instead. \",\"assistant\",[118]],[\"s126\",\"d9\",1451,1708,\"Sometimes, the competitive spirit can overshadow the pure joy of creating and sharing food, leading one to wonder if it’s worth the stress rather than simply cherishing the act of cooking for the pleasure it brings, both to ourselves and to those we serve. \",\"assistant\",[118]],[\"s127\",\"d9\",1708,1919,\"So, it’s perfectly valid to feel this way, which may lead you to consider how you approach cooking in the future; focusing more on enjoyment rather than competition might be a way to reconnect with that passion.\",\"assistant\",[118]],[\"s128\",\"d10\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 107–108 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s129\",\"d10\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s130\",\"d10\",107,496,\"User: I started an herb garden at home to ensure I have fresh ingredients for my cooking. The idea came to me while browsing through a cooking magazine that featured vibrant photographs of lush gardens filled with different herbs. I realized that I wanted to incorporate more fresh flavors into my meals, rather than relying solely on dried spices that often lose their potency over time. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s131\",\"d10\",496,769,\"The process of planting seeds and watching them grow has not only been rewarding but also therapeutic, allowing me to reconnect with nature. Each day, I look forward to tending to my little garden and imagining all the delicious dishes I can create with my homegrown herbs.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s132\",\"d10\",769,782,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s133\",\"d10\",782,1104,\"Assistant: That's a smart way to enhance your dishes. Herbs can really elevate a meal, adding not just flavor but also fresh aromas that can transform the dining experience. Moreover, growing your own herbs means you have access to fresh ingredients right at your fingertips, which can inspire creativity in your cooking. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s134\",\"d10\",1104,1470,\"Imagine plucking fresh basil or oregano seconds before adding them to a sauce, their vibrant oils spilling forth to mingle with other ingredients; it’s a sensory experience that simply cannot be matched by dried options. Additionally, I commend you for embracing gardening, as it requires patience and dedication, qualities that are essential in many areas of life. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s135\",\"d10\",1470,1815,\"The benefits of gardening extend far beyond the culinary realm, providing you with a sense of accomplishment as you nurture and cultivate your plants. This kind of project also promotes sustainability, as you're lessening your reliance on store-bought herbs that may have traveled long distances and often come packaged with unwanted chemicals. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s136\",\"d10\",1815,2111,\"From the thrill of planting to the joy of harvesting, each step of this journey is filled with anticipation and excitement. I can only imagine how delightful it must be to step outside and breathe in the fresh scents of your garden while picturing the delicious meals awaiting you in the kitchen.\",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s137\",\"d11\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 54–55 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s138\",\"d11\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s139\",\"d11\",105,493,\"User: Absolutely! It felt like a more relaxed environment to get to know someone while focusing on something fun. The atmosphere was vibrant and inviting, filled with the tantalizing aromas of diverse ingredients coming together. We laughed and shared stories while chopping vegetables and stirring pots, making the experience not just about cooking but about connection and camaraderie. \",\"user\",[54]],[\"s140\",\"d11\",493,737,\"It was fascinating to see how cooking has the ability to break down barriers and create a sense of community among strangers. Each dish we created became a topic of discussion, allowing us to bond over our culinary successes and failures alike.\",\"user\",[54]],[\"s141\",\"d11\",737,750,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s142\",\"d11\",750,1035,\"Assistant: Cooking classes can be great for fostering connections, and it's wonderful to hear that you had such a delightful experience! They often provide a unique opportunity to engage with others in a creative and interactive setting, much different from typical social gatherings. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s143\",\"d11\",1035,1223,\"By focusing on the task of preparing a meal, participants can naturally shift their attention away from the pressure of forming a connection, which can make interactions flow more freely. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s144\",\"d11\",1223,1450,\"Additionally, the collaborative nature of working together on recipes often leads to shared achievements, sparking conversations about personal tastes, cooking backgrounds, and even cherished family traditions related to food. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s145\",\"d11\",1450,1641,\"Such an environment not only enhances culinary skills but also builds friendships that can extend beyond the kitchen, helping to create lasting memories and connections that enrich our lives.\",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s146\",\"d12\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 27–28 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s147\",\"d12\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s148\",\"d12\",105,353,\"User: I signed up for a dance class recently, but honestly, I felt out of place. The studio was filled with people who seemed to have an innate talent for dancing, gliding effortlessly across the floor, while I struggled to keep up with the tempo. \",\"user\",[27]],[\"s149\",\"d12\",353,654,\"It was disheartening to feel like I was just a spectator instead of a participant, and I couldn't shake off the sense of self-consciousness that followed me throughout the session. My mind raced with thoughts about how others perceived me—perhaps they saw me as clumsy or out of sync with the rhythm. \",\"user\",[27]],[\"s150\",\"d12\",654,824,\"I realized that dancing just might not be my forte, and I began to question whether I should explore other hobbies that could allow me to express myself more comfortably.\",\"user\",[27]],[\"s151\",\"d12\",824,837,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s152\",\"d12\",837,1139,\"Assistant: It’s perfectly fine to find some activities unappealing; everyone has their own unique interests and comfort zones. Dancing, while an expressive and vibrant art form, can sometimes feel overwhelming, especially when one is surrounded by more seasoned dancers who exude confidence and skill. \",\"assistant\",[28]],[\"s153\",\"d12\",1139,1436,\"Remember, it’s important to engage in activities that spark joy and do not lead to discomfort or feelings of inadequacy. Perhaps there are other forms of movement or creative expression that could resonate with you more profoundly, such as painting, writing, or even exploring outdoor activities. \",\"assistant\",[28]],[\"s154\",\"d12\",1436,1767,\"Sharing your experiences with friends or seeking out clubs that match your interests might lead to opportunities where you feel more at ease and truly yourself. What types of dates do you usually enjoy instead, as they might offer a clearer picture of your personal preferences and what you find enriching during your leisure time?\",\"assistant\",[28]]],\"requ