7f8a4\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"a103a2ae4f6ab1bc53690d2ec31da352645527ca92fbff10792335d4dde417ff\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"0d3abfcc7ead40f08d633fa98740d5cb23ca04f995c6c16b7fdd81f172970a39\"},\"variables\":{\"constraints\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"constraints\",\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"constraints\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"constraints\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_180cd6ee14abd9e321ad213b\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has no reported dietary restrictions, has access to a kitchen and basic cooking equipment (stove, oven, utensils), enjoys hands-on cooking experiences, prefers active participation over passive viewing, and is open to exploring diverse cuisines (Italian, Thai, and other international dishes). The user has taken cooking classes and workshops, started a food blog, and seeks to expand culinary skills and techniques.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s56\",\"s21\",\"s38\",\"s19\",\"s57\",\"s73\",\"s20\",\"s12\",\"s4\",\"s11\",\"s39\",\"s74\",\"s72\",\"s3\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user expresses a passion for cooking, experimenting with cuisines (Italian, Thai), taking classes, and preferring hands-on experiences. No dietary restrictions or equipment limitations are mentioned. The user enjoys exploring diverse culinary traditions and sharing experiences via a blog.\",\"variable\":\"constraints\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,432,\"User: I've been exploring my passion for food lately, especially cooking. Cooking has become a delightful escape for me, a means of expressing my creativity and bringing joy to others. The process of selecting fresh ingredients, experimenting with different flavors, and presenting a dish beautifully is incredibly fulfilling. \",\"user\",[93]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",432,769,\"I often find myself lost in the nuances of taste and texture, and it's rewarding to see how a simple meal can evoke such happiness in those who share it with me. Lately, I've been trying to perfect my skills in making different cuisines, from Italian to Thai, and it has opened up a whole new world of culinary traditions and techniques.\",\"user\",[93]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",105,392,\"User: I even took a cooking class recently to learn new techniques and recipes, which was really enlightening! It was fascinating to explore not just the recipes but also the cultural background behind them, as many dishes come with rich histories that deepen our appreciation for food. \",\"user\",[95]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",392,791,\"The hands-on experience of preparing different cuisines has really expanded my palate and made me consider how flavors interact in cooking. I also got to meet some amazing fellow food enthusiasts who shared their own stories and tips during the class, creating a vibrant community focused on culinary arts. Overall, it was much more than a class; it felt like a journey into the heart of gastronomy.\",\"user\",[95]],[\"s19\",\"d3\",107,464,\"User: I really enjoy experimenting with different cuisines, and I recently made a traditional dish from another culture, which was quite an intriguing experience. The colorful ingredients and the rich history behind each recipe often inspire me to learn more about the culture itself, broadening my culinary horizons and appreciation for global traditions. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",464,817,\"It's fascinating to think about how food serves as a bridge between people, fostering connections and understanding through shared meals and flavors. I often find that every dish tells a story of its origins, the journeys of the ingredients, and the techniques passed down through generations, making cooking a deeply personal and cultural exploration. \",\"user\",[111]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",817,997,\"This experience was particularly enlightening because I learned not only about the ingredients but also about the customs and rituals that accompany the dish in its native context.\",\"user\",[111]],[\"s38\",\"d4\",107,503,\"User: I also watched a cooking show, but I found it unengaging; I much prefer hands-on experiences. The imagery and techniques presented may have been appealing, but they lacked the personal touch that comes with actually cooking for myself. There’s something incredibly rewarding about selecting fresh ingredients, measuring them precisely, and then seeing them transform into a delicious dish. \",\"user\",[115]],[\"s39\",\"d4\",503,838,\"Watching someone else cook, no matter how talented they are, can't replicate the joy of feeling the textures of this food in my hands and tasting the flavors as they meld together. Moreover, in a hands-on experience, I can experiment and adjust flavors to suit my personal preferences, something that a static show simply cannot offer.\",\"user\",[115]],[\"s56\",\"d5\",105,458,\"User: I joined a couples cooking workshop to explore new cuisines and meet new people. It was really enjoyable! The atmosphere in the kitchen was vibrant, filled with the aroma of spices and fresh ingredients. We were all eagerly trying to follow the chef's instructions, which made for some entertaining moments when things didn’t quite go as planned. \",\"user\",[69]],[\"s57\",\"d5\",458,745,\"I particularly loved the way everyone seemed to open up and share stories about their culinary experiences, which truly made it feel like a communal gathering rather than a formal class. Overall, it was a delightful way to blend learning with social interaction and culinary exploration.\",\"user\",[69]],[\"s72\",\"d6\",107,393,\"User: I decided to start a food blog to share my dining experiences and tips with others. This decision comes from my passion for exploring new cuisines and discovering hidden gems in my community, as well as my desire to connect with like-minded individuals who share a love for food. \",\"user\",[101]],[\"s73\",\"d6\",393,760,\"I've spent countless weekends trying out different restaurants, from bustling diners to upscale bistros, all in search of unique flavors and culinary innovations. I feel that documenting my experiences will not only help me remember the wonderful meals I've enjoyed but also provide valuable insights for readers who might be looking for their next dining adventure. \",\"user\",[101]],[\"s74\",\"d6\",760,897,\"Additionally, I hope to inspire others to step outside their culinary comfort zones and try dishes they may have never considered before.\",\"user\",[101]],[\"s75\",\"d6\",897,910,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s76\",\"d6\",910,1233,\"Assistant: That's a wonderful idea! Blogging can really connect you with fellow food lovers, creating a vibrant community where shared experiences and insights can flourish. As you embark on this blogging journey, remember that your unique perspective and storytelling will be key in attracting and engaging your audience. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s77\",\"d6\",1233,1615,\"Not only can you share your honest reviews, but you can also include interesting anecdotes about the places you visit, such as the ambiance, the service, and even the stories behind the dishes you enjoy. Consider incorporating some beautiful photos of your meals, as visual appeal is significant in food blogging, helping to entice readers and invite them into your culinary world. \",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s78\",\"d6\",1615,1985,\"Furthermore, engaging with your readers through comments and social media can enhance your blog's reach, allowing you to gain valuable feedback and foster relationships with others who are just as passionate about dining as you are. Overall, your initiative can lead to a fulfilling creative outlet while also contributing to a wider conversation about food and culture.\",\"assistant\",[102]],[\"s79\",\"d7\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 17–18 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s80\",\"d7\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s81\",\"d7\",105,392,\"User: I also organized a cooking date for a friend recently, and it was truly wonderful to see them connect over the process of creating something delicious together. There's just something magical about the way preparing food can break down barriers and foster intimacy between people. \",\"user\",[17]],[\"s82\",\"d7\",392,771,\"As they chopped vegetables and stirred sauces, you could feel the energy in the room shift, turning what might normally be a routine task into a delightful exercise in teamwork. I enjoyed watching them share laughter as they navigated the kitchen, discovering who was better at whisking or flipping pancakes, which added an element of playful competition to their time together. \",\"user\",[17]],[\"s83\",\"d7\",771,948,\"Their enthusiasm for trying new recipes turned a simple evening into a memorable culinary adventure, filled with joy and camaraderie that I hope helped to strengthen their bond.\",\"user\",[17]],[\"s84\",\"d7\",948,961,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s85\",\"d7\",961,1165,\"Assistant: Cooking dates can indeed be a great bonding experience for couples, as they provide an opportunity not just for collaboration but also for communication and connection in a delightful setting. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s86\",\"d7\",1165,1495,\"When partners engage in preparing a meal together, they are not only sharing an activity but also the rich tapestry of their cultures, tastes, and preferences, which can lead to deeper understanding. The sights and smells of sizzling ingredients or the sounds of laughter truly create a warm atmosphere that can be so fulfilling. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s87\",\"d7\",1495,1695,\"Furthermore, sharing the culinary process often involves learning about each other's strengths, weaknesses, and personal styles, laying the foundation for teamwork that can extend beyond the kitchen. \",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s88\",\"d7\",1695,1932,\"It's fascinating how food acts as a universal language, bridging differences and bringing people closer, making such moments memorable not only for the delicious results but also for the shared experiences that enrich their relationship.\",\"assistant\",[18]],[\"s89\",\"d8\",0,100,\"Conversation message indices 99–100 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s90\",\"d8\",100,106,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s91\",\"d8\",106,387,\"User: I even participated in a food photography contest where I showcased some dishes from my recent travels. The experience was not just about capturing images; it was also a wonderful opportunity to reflect on the flavors and textures that each dish represented from my journey. \",\"user\",[99]],[\"s92\",\"d8\",387,711,\"I spent hours curating the perfect shots, considering the lighting, angles, and the vibrant colors of the food, which all told a story of the culture I was immersed in. It was exciting to share those moments with others who appreciate culinary artistry as much as I do, creating a sense of community among the participants. \",\"user\",[99]],[\"s93\",\"d8\",711,901,\"The contest also pushed me to step outside my comfort zone and try new photography techniques that I hadn't considered before, making the process both a challenge and a rewarding experience.\",\"user\",[99]],[\"s94\",\"d8\",901,914,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s95\",\"d8\",914,1158,\"Assistant: That sounds like a fantastic way to capture your culinary adventures. It must have been thrilling to blend your love for travel with your passion for photography, creating both visual and memory-filled artifacts of your experiences. \",\"assistant\",[100]],[\"s96\",\"d8\",1158,1530,\"I can only imagine the creativity that flowed through you as you positioned each dish, knowing that every small detail could significantly impact the overall aesthetics of the shot. Such opportunities not only improve technical skills but also deepen one’s appreciation for cultural diversity, as food often reflects a community's history and traditions, don’t you think? \",\"assistant\",[100]],[\"s97\",\"d8\",1530,1879,\"How did the judges respond to your work, and did they offer any feedback that resonated with you? There’s always something to learn from sharing our passions in a competitive yet friendly setting. Reflecting on your journey while showcasing dishes sounds like a nurturing endeavor that allows you to connect with others who share similar interests. \",\"assistant\",[100]],[\"s98\",\"d8\",1879,2094,\"What were some of the standout memories you captured during your travels that made it into the contest? Did you find particular dishes that resonated with you on a personal level, perhaps even reminding you of home?\",\"assistant\",[100]],[\"s128\",\"d9\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 107–108 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s129\",\"d9\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s130\",\"d9\",107,496,\"User: I started an herb garden at home to ensure I have fresh ingredients for my cooking. The idea came to me while browsing through a cooking magazine that featured vibrant photographs of lush gardens filled with different herbs. I realized that I wanted to incorporate more fresh flavors into my meals, rather than relying solely on dried spices that often lose their potency over time. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s131\",\"d9\",496,769,\"The process of planting seeds and watching them grow has not only been rewarding but also therapeutic, allowing me to reconnect with nature. Each day, I look forward to tending to my little garden and imagining all the delicious dishes I can create with my homegrown herbs.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s132\",\"d9\",769,782,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s133\",\"d9\",782,1104,\"Assistant: That's a smart way to enhance your dishes. Herbs can really elevate a meal, adding not just flavor but also fresh aromas that can transform the dining experience. Moreover, growing your own herbs means you have access to fresh ingredients right at your fingertips, which can inspire creativity in your cooking. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s134\",\"d9\",1104,1470,\"Imagine plucking fresh basil or oregano seconds before adding them to a sauce, their vibrant oils spilling forth to mingle with other ingredients; it’s a sensory experience that simply cannot be matched by dried options. Additionally, I commend you for embracing gardening, as it requires patience and dedication, qualities that are essential in many areas of life. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s135\",\"d9\",1470,1815,\"The benefits of gardening extend far beyond the culinary realm, providing you with a sense of accomplishment as you nurture and cultivate your plants. This kind of project also promotes sustainability, as you're lessening your reliance on store-bought herbs that may have traveled long distances and often come packaged with unwanted chemicals. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s136\",\"d9\",1815,2111,\"From the thrill of planting to the joy of harvesting, each step of this journey is filled with anticipation and excitement. I can only imagine how delightful it must be to step outside and breathe in the fresh scents of your garden while picturing the delicious meals awaiting you in the kitchen.\",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s137\",\"d10\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 54–55 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s138\",\"d10\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s139\",\"d10\",105,493,\"User: Absolutely! It felt like a more relaxed environment to get to know someone while focusing on something fun. The atmosphere was vibrant and inviting, filled with the tantalizing aromas of diverse ingredients coming together. We laughed and shared stories while chopping vegetables and stirring pots, making the experience not just about cooking but about connection and camaraderie. \",\"user\",[54]],[\"s140\",\"d10\",493,737,\"It was fascinating to see how cooking has the ability to break down barriers and create a sense of community among strangers. Each dish we created became a topic of discussion, allowing us to bond over our culinary successes and failures alike.\",\"user\",[54]],[\"s141\",\"d10\",737,750,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s142\",\"d10\",750,1035,\"Assistant: Cooking classes can be great for fostering connections, and it's wonderful to hear that you had such a delightful experience! They often provide a unique opportunity to engage with others in a creative and interactive setting, much different from typical social gatherings. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s143\",\"d10\",1035,1223,\"By focusing on the task of preparing a meal, participants can naturally shift their attention away from the pressure of forming a connection, which can make interactions flow more freely. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s144\",\"d10\",1223,1450,\"Additionally, the collaborative nature of working together on recipes often leads to shared achievements, sparking conversations about personal tastes, cooking backgrounds, and even cherished family traditions related to food. \",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s145\",\"d10\",1450,1641,\"Such an environment not only enhances culinary skills but also builds friendships that can extend beyond the kitchen, helping to create lasting memories and connections that enrich our lives.\",\"assistant\",[55]],[\"s155\",\"d11\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 127–128 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s156\",\"d11\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s157\",\"d11\",107,436,\"User: I attempted to delve deeper into the realm of nutrition, motivated by a desire to understand what it truly means to eat healthily and how it can impact my overall well-being. However, as I navigated through the myriad of information and guidelines, I was often left feeling inundated by the sheer volume of data available. \",\"user\",[127]],[\"s158\",\"d11\",436,776,\"The scientific jargon and complicated dietary theories felt like a heavy fog that clouded my understanding, making it difficult to uncover practical, actionable insights. Not only did I find the material challenging to digest mentally, but it also lacked the engaging elements that would have otherwise sparked my curiosity and enthusiasm. \",\"user\",[127]],[\"s159\",\"d11\",776,915,\"This left me pondering if there might be a more accessible way to approach these topics without feeling lost in a sea of facts and figures.\",\"user\",[127]],[\"s160\",\"d11\",915,928,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s161\",\"d11\",928,1180,\"Assistant: Nutrition, indeed, can be an intricate and multifaceted subject, encompassing various disciplines such as biology, chemistry, and even psychology, all of which work together to create a complete picture of how our bodies interact with food. \",\"assistant\",[128]],[\"s162\",\"d11\",1180,1417,\"The complexity arises from the fact that nutritional needs can vary greatly from person to person due to factors like age, gender, activity level, and individual health goals, making it a uniquely personal journey for everyone involved. \",\"assistant\",[128]],[\"s163\",\"d11\",1417,1654,\"Sometimes when information becomes overwhelming, it can help to take a step back and adopt a more intuitive approach to eating, focusing on whole foods rather than getting bogged down by every detail of macronutrients or micronutrients. \",\"assistant\",[128]],[\"s164\",\"d11\",1654,1886,\"By cultivating an awareness of your body's signals and understanding what foods make you feel energized and satisfied, nutrition can transform from an intimidating science into a fulfilling and enjoyable part of your daily routine. \",\"assistant\",[128]],[\"s165\",\"d11\",1886,2161,\"Perhaps exploring simple recipes or starting with basic principles of meal planning could rekindle your interest in the subject as you gradually become more comfortable with the concepts, ultimately leading to a healthier lifestyle that feels both sustainable and empowering.\",\"assistant\",[128]],[\"s166\",\"d12\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 109–110 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s167\",\"d12\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s168\",\"d12\",107,398,\"User: I've been meal prepping lately to save time and focus on eating healthier. It really helps to cook in bulk, allowing me to create healthy meals that I can enjoy throughout the week. I find that I’m less tempted to eat out when I have nutritious options readily available in my fridge. \",\"user\",[109]],[\"s169\",\"d12\",398,677,\"On busy days, I just grab a prepped meal instead of scrambling to put something together last minute, which can often lead to unhealthy choices. Additionally, I enjoy experimenting with different recipes and flavors, so meal prepping has opened up new culinary adventures for me.\",\"user\",[109]],[\"s170\",\"d12\",677,690,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s171\",\"d12\",690,1086,\"Assistant: Meal prepping is such a practical approach! It must make your week a lot easier, not just in terms of convenience, but also mentally, as it can take the stress out of meal planning each day. When you have those meals set and ready to go, it allows you more time to focus on other important aspects of your life, such as work, hobbies, and spending quality time with family or friends. \",\"assistant\",[110]],[\"s172\",\"d12\",1086,1379,\"Plus, by planning your meals, you are likely to save money as well since you are less inclined to buy takeout or unnecessary food. This not only benefits your wallet but also empowers you to take control of your nutritional intake, ensuring you get the vitamins and nutrients your body needs. \",\"assistant\",[110]],[\"s173\",\"d12\",1379,1689,\"Moreover, it’s fascinating to think about how meal prepping can mold your entire week, affecting your energy levels and overall mood. Knowing what you're going to eat can alleviate the mental load of decision-making, which often adds an extra layer of stress to our busy lives, allowing for a smoother routine.\",\"assistant\",[110]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"constraints\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_180cd6ee14abd9e321ad213b\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s56\",\"s21\",\"s38\",\"s19\",\"s57\",\"s73\",\"s20\",\"s12\",\"s4\",\"s11\",\"s39\",\"s74\",\"s72\",\"s3\"]}},\"repair_scope\":{\"failed\":[{\"variable\":\"constraints\",\"id\":\"fact_180cd6ee14abd9e321ad213b\",\"feedback\":\"citation_capacity: mandatory semantic_compose at response exceeds the actual context including repair reserve. Recheck this same draft; cite the shortest sufficient original spans, not the whole reading window. Keep every necessary premise \",\"observation\":{\"id\":\"fact_180cd6ee14abd9e321ad213b\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has no reported dietary restrictions, has access to a kitchen and basic cooking equipment (stove, oven, utensils), enjoys hands-on cooking experiences, prefers active participation over passive viewing, and is open to exploring diverse cuisines (Italian, Thai, and other international dishes). The user has taken cooking classes and workshops, started a food blog, and seeks to expand culinary skills and techniques. The user also started an herb garden at home for fresh ingredients, engages in meal prepping for convenience and healthier eating, and has attempted to learn about nutrition but found it overwhelming.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s56\",\"s21\",\"s38\",\"s19\",\"s57\",\"s73\",\"s20\",\"s12\",\"s4\",\"s11\",\"s39\",\"s74\",\"s72\",\"s3\",\"s130\",\"s131\",\"s168\",\"s169\",\"s157\",\"s158\",\"s159\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user expresses a passion for cooking, experimenting with cuisines (Italian, Thai), taking classes, and preferring hands-on experiences. No dietary restrictions or equipment limitations are mentioned. The user enjoys exploring diverse culinary traditions and sharing experiences via a blog. Additional evidence shows the user started an herb garden (s130, s131), meal preps (s168, s169), and found nutrition information overwhelming (s157, s158, s159). These are compatible additions to the existing summary.\",\"summary_revision\":{\"supersedes_route_ids\":[\"fact_180cd6ee14abd9e321ad213b\"],\"previous_version\":1,\"reason\":\"Incorporates new compatible evidence about herb garden, meal prepping, and nutrition exploration into the existing summary, preserving all prior facts and sources.\"}}}],\"attempt\":1,\"previous_response_identity\":\"4f66181df5c05ac2cc989da45e3f1bf0684fa6436e74cebeec1b4aa3b8b2ae71\"},\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e532164f4811a26fc503ea6a47fe72f69d8aca1fb4c475c408ffa60f0908d856\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":93.0,\"observed_end\":94.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:71daa07ec7d9fdbaf4a830ba8fdead8251507af7b9c014fe4ca59aa70488ff0b\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":95.0,\"observed_end\":96.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null